DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270717
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270718
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Marina\, Fournoi
LOCATION:Fournoi\, Fournoi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The first summer panigiri of Fournoi: liturgy at the chapel of Agia Marina in the Varela area\, then from about 21:00 the cultural association takes over the village square with live island music\, goat\, mezedes and wine. The whole island turns up\, so arrive early for a table.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/fournoi/#fournoi-panigiri-of-agia-marina-fournoi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/fournoi/#fournoi-panigiri-of-agia-marina-fournoi
END:VEVENT
