BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fournoi-fournoi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-on-the-harbour-fournoi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition on the harbour\, Fournoi
LOCATION:Fournoi\, Fournoi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's biggest night: on 15 August from about 20:00 the cultural association sets tables along the harbour for homemade goat dishes\, mezedes and wine\, with a live traditional orchestra and dancing. Ferries from Ikaria and Samos are full that week\; if you are day-tripping there is no late boat back\, so book a room.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/fournoi/#fournoi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-on-the-harbour-fournoi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/fournoi/#fournoi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-on-the-harbour-fournoi
END:VEVENT
